error[E0537]: 'label' is not an instance field of class 'Child'
 --> $DIR/shorthand-inherited-field.nra:7:39
  |
7 |     export let init = func(size: int, label: string) => set;
  |                                       ^^^^^ 'label' is inherited, and the shorthand sets only the class's own fields
  |                                                         --- '=> set' stores each parameter in the field of the same name
  |
  = help: name the parameter after an instance field of this class, or write the constructor with a block

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0537`.
